Z||000009||Ironhorse||04-04-2000||02:41 PM||||I found out something I didn't want know.  I went to several auto stores including pontiac dealers.  The computer for 85 and 86 is completely different.  I must say I really really love the pontiac dealer, they have been very very very helpful NOT!!!! The guy basically told me have a nice day with a f*ck you look on his face.  Guess I'm gonna hafta bite the bullet and shell out 90bucks for the computer.  Look at it this way if I buy the Fiero and the computer. I only paid 590 bucks for it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Just one more thing... when I switch the computer is there anything I need to look out for and check anything that associated with the computer?  THANKS A MILLION.  <P>P.S. Turbo86se, patient patient, I gotta get the car (tow it in) and get some film to take a pic of the car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||9
